OK   every state means what the table says (count of 01 so far, last symbol 0 or not), |w| <= 12
OK   DFA is exactly equivalent to the counting machine built from the statement
OK   regular expression 1*00*11*00*11*0* is exactly equivalent to the DFA
OK   the 7-state DFA is minimal
OK   representatives ε, 0, 01, 010, 0101, 01010, 010101 reach the seven states in order
OK   they form a fooling set (every pair has a distinguishing suffix)  [ε/0:'101'; ε/01:'01'; ε/010:'1'; ε/0101:''; ε/01010:''; ε/010101:'0101'; 0/01:'01'; 0/010:'1'; 0/0101:''; 0/01010:''; 0/010101:'101'; 01/010:'1'; 01/0101:''; 01/01010:''; 01/010101:'01'; 010/0101:''; 010/01010:''; 010/010101:'1'; 0101/01010:'1'; 0101/010101:''; 01010/010101:'']
