OK   M2 (no 00) is correct and its states mean safe / zero / dead, |w| <= 14
OK   product (intersection) accepts exactly L, |w| <= 14
OK   the page's 9-row transition table is the product's transition function
OK   start (0, safe); accepting {(0, safe), (0, zero)}
OK   all 9 product states are reachable; 1^r 00 reaches (r, dead)
OK   the three (r, dead) states are pairwise equivalent; every other pair is distinguishable
OK   the minimal DFA for L has 7 states
OK   fooling-set strings reach (0,safe), (1,safe), (2,safe), (0,zero), (1,zero), (2,zero), (·,dead)
OK   page's suffix rule: for every pair, x z in L and y z not in L (21 pairs)  [ε/1:ε; ε/11:ε; ε/0:0; ε/10:ε; ε/110:ε; ε/00:ε; 1/11:11; 1/0:11; 1/10:011; 1/110:11; 1/00:11; 11/0:1; 11/10:1; 11/110:01; 11/00:1; 0/10:ε; 0/110:ε; 0/00:ε; 10/110:11; 10/00:11; 110/00:1]
